# Original Marble Recovery level (2026-10-04). Not derived from any Marble Madness course.
# Teaches: bullies. Iron marbles, heavier than yours, that roll straight at you and
# knock you flying. They do not care about edges: step aside at the last moment and
# let them roll off, or lead them round the hole in the plaza.
name: Bully Ridge
time: 70
